  "id": "sce264:017A7",
  "jp": "ゲン「大丈夫。みんなが黙ってればわかんないって。{nl}　ホラ、メルヴィも行くぞ」",
  "off": 6055,
  "len": 46,
  "en": "Gen: It's fine. If nobody says anything, nobody'll know. C'mon, Melvi, let's go.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6057,
  "text_len": 43
 },
 {
  "id": "sce264:017D8",
  "jp": "メルヴィ「あっ、ゲ、ゲンちゃん‥‥」",
  "off": 6104,
  "len": 23,
  "en": "Melvi: Ah, G-Gen-chan...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6106,
  "text_len": 20
 },
 {
  "id": "sce264:017F2",
  "jp": "ゲン「んじゃ、このことはここにいるみんなの秘密{nl}　ということで」",
  "off": 6130,
  "len": 37,
  "en": "Gen: Okay, so this stays a secret between everybody here.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6132,
  "text_len": 34
 },
 {
  "id": "sce264:0182A",
  "jp": "ヤマト「‥‥あたし達も退散するとしましょ」",
  "off": 6186,
  "len": 29,
  "en": "Yamato: ...Let's make ourselves scarce too.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6188,
  "text_len": 26
 },
 {
  "id": "sce264:0184A",
  "jp": "トウヤ「あ、ああ‥‥」",
  "off": 6218,
  "len": 16,
  "en": "Touya: Oh, r-right...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6220,
  "text_len": 13
 },
 {
  "id": "sce264:01936",
  "jp": "ヤマト「あれ？　エレベーターが動いてる。めずらしいわね。{nl}　誰か乗ってるのかしら？」",
  "off": 6454,
  "len": 52,
  "en": "Yamato: Huh? The elevator's moving. That's rare. I wonder if someone's riding it?",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6456,
  "text_len": 49
 },
 {
  "id": "sce264:0196D",
  "jp": "トウヤ「そりゃ、乗るだろ」",
  "off": 6509,
  "len": 17,
  "en": "Touya: Well, yeah, people ride it.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6511,
  "text_len": 14
 },
 {
  "id": "sce264:01981",
  "jp": "ヤマト「でも、あたしが見るときはいつも止まってるよ。{nl}　しかもちょうどその階に」",
  "off": 6529,
  "len": 46,
  "en": "Yamato: But whenever I look, it's always stopped. And right on this floor, too.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6531,
  "text_len": 43
 },
 {
  "id": "sce264:019B2",
  "jp": "トウヤ「気のせいだ。気のせい。それより‥‥」",
  "off": 6578,
  "len": 29,
  "en": "Touya: Your imagination. Just your imagination. More importantly...",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6580,
  "text_len": 26
 },
 {
  "id": "sce264:019D9",
  "jp": "ヤマト「あっ、止まった」",
  "off": 6617,
  "len": 16,
  "en": "Yamato: Oh, it stopped.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6619,
  "text_len": 13
 },
 {
  "id": "sce264:019F3",
  "jp": "フェイン「はははははははっ！{nl}　愛する人を守る為、正義の刃が敵を撃つ！{nl}　赤い血潮を真っ赤に燃やし、それが男の生きる道！{nl}　正義と真実の男！{nl}　フェイィィン、ジィィン、バァァァリィオォォン‼{nl}　只今、推参！　正義のためなら‥‥死ねる」",
  "off": 6643,
  "len": 158,
  "en": "Fain: Hahahahahahaha! To protect the one I love, the blade of justice strikes the foe! Setting my red blood ablaze, such is the path a man must walk! The man of justice and truth! Faaaain, Jiiiin, Baaariooooon!! Now arriving! For justice... I would die.",
  "status": "translated",
  "style": 0,
  "text_off": 6645,
  "text_len": 155
 },
